### Pedidos360 - kafka-admin-service (http://localhost:8083)
### Todas las rutas /api/** exigen un JWT de Microsoft Entra ID con el App Role ADMIN.
### Pega el Access Token (sin "Bearer") en la variable de abajo.

@base = http://localhost:8083
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Salud (publico)
GET {{base}}/public/health

### Estado del cluster: brokers y controlador
GET {{base}}/api/cluster
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar topicos (internos=true incluye __consumer_offsets)
GET {{base}}/api/topics?internos=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear un topico con particiones, replicas y configuraciones
POST {{base}}/api/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "pedidos360.reportes.diarios",
  "partitions": 3,
  "replicationFactor": 3,
  "configs": {
    "cleanup.policy": "delete",
    "retention.ms": "86400000",
    "min.insync.replicas": "2"
  }
}

### Detalle: lider, replicas, ISR, configuracion personalizada y efectiva
GET {{base}}/api/topics/pedidos360.reportes.diarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificar configuraciones (solo cambian las indicadas)
PUT {{base}}/api/topics/pedidos360.reportes.diarios/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "configs": { "retention.ms": "259200000", "compression.type": "lz4" } }

### Restablecer una configuracion al valor por defecto del broker
DELETE {{base}}/api/topics/pedidos360.reportes.diarios/configs/compression.type
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aumentar particiones (Kafka no permite reducirlas)
PATCH {{base}}/api/topics/pedidos360.reportes.diarios/partitions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partitions": 6 }

### Eliminar un topico (los topicos de Pedidos360 estan protegidos -> 409)
DELETE {{base}}/api/topics/pedidos360.reportes.diarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar consumer groups
GET {{base}}/api/consumer-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle de un grupo: miembros, particiones asignadas, offsets y lag
GET {{base}}/api/consumer-groups/pedidos360-analitica
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reiniciar offsets (el grupo debe estar detenido) - destino EARLIEST | LATEST | OFFSET
POST {{base}}/api/consumer-groups/pedidos360-auditoria/reset-offsets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "topic": "pedidos360.pedidos.eventos", "destino": "EARLIEST" }

### Eliminar un consumer group sin consumidores activos
DELETE {{base}}/api/consumer-groups/pedidos360-reportes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
